{
  "name": "Alibaba Scraper: Wholesale Products & Factory Finder — Automated Extraction to CSV & Sheets (UnitBytes)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Alibaba Scraper: Wholesale Products & Factory Finder — Automated n8n Pipeline\n**Powered by [UnitBytes on Apify](https://apify.com/unitbytes/alibaba-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** ($0.005 / item)\n\n### ⚙️ How It Works\nThis workflow runs on a schedule, calls the **[alibaba-scraper Apify Actor](https://apify.com/unitbytes/alibaba-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** via its synchronous REST endpoint, normalizes the extracted fields (`id, offerId, productId, title, url`), and exports a clean CSV file.\n\n### 🚀 30-Second Setup Instructions\n1. **Get your free Apify API Token**: Open [alibaba-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/alibaba-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) and copy your API token from **Settings → Integrations**.\n2. **Paste your token & search parameters**: Double-click the **\"1. Set Apify Token & Input\"** node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. **Click \"Test Workflow\"**: The HTTP Request node calls the synchronous UnitBytes Apify endpoint, normalizes the extracted records, and exports a clean CSV file ready for Google Sheets, Airtable, Slack, or OpenAI.\n\n📖 **Documentation & Schema Reference**: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/alibaba-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/alibaba-scraper/)",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0ff9b98d-e198-5bf5-bda9-d20005080506",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 📊 Connect Your Destination\nThe **\"3. Normalize Output Fields\"** node outputs flat records (`id, offerId, productId, title, url`).\n\n- **Google Sheets / Airtable**: Connect a Google Sheets (`Append or Update Row`) node after Step 3.\n- **Slack / Telegram / Email Alerts**: Connect a Filter node + Slack node to alert your team on new deals or reviews.\n- **AI Agent / OpenAI**: Connect an OpenAI / LLM Chain node to summarize or classify extracted items.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "582a2225-acfd-55f9-9f1d-0de3aee9d035",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Destinations",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "eea29803-ca1c-5383-924d-a21dc8cad3a6",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "23a58ebd-b9be-57ad-afa3-7437cadcc2c3",
              "name": "apifyToken",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cd25612d-1cca-5cb1-ae28-6c7b5fb8fcb7",
              "name": "actorInput",
              "value": "{\"keyword\": \"wireless earbuds\", \"proxyConfiguration\": {\"useApifyProxy\": true}}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cece4b15-2212-5a33-924a-30665a1f8016",
      "name": "1. Set Apify Token & Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/unitbytes~alibaba-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items?token={{ $json.apifyToken }}&format=json&clean=true",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.actorInput) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "c7197c19-9057-5aef-999e-d1b6d3a2ade9",
      "name": "2. Run UnitBytes (alibaba-scraper)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
